<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>MascottesWorld - Location de mascottes en Île-de-France</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: #f4f4f9;
            color: #333;
        }
        header {
            background: linear-gradient(45deg, #7b2cbf, #4a4eff, #ff67a1);
            color: white;
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        header h1 {
            margin: 0;
        }
        nav {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 10px;
        }
        nav a {
            color: #7b2cbf;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin: 0 15px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        .section {
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .gallery {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 20px;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .gallery img {
            width: 150px;
            height: auto;
            border-radius: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }
        .form-container {
            background-color: white;
            border-radius: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            padding: 20px;
            max-width: 500px;
            margin: 20px auto;
        }
        .form-container form {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }
        .form-container label {
            text-align: left;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        .form-container input, .form-container textarea, .form-container button {
            padding: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
            border-radius: 5px;
        }
        .form-container button {
            background: linear-gradient(45deg, #7b2cbf, #4a4eff);
            color: white;
            border: none;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
        .form-container button:hover {
            background: linear-gradient(45deg, #4a4eff, #7b2cbf);
        }
        footer {
            background: #7b2cbf;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 10px;
        }
        .date-planner {
            margin: 20px auto;
            max-width: 500px;
            padding: 20px;
            background: white;
            border-radius: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }
        .date-planner h3 {
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }
        .date-planner select, .date-planner button {
            padding: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
            border-radius: 5px;
            width: 100%;
        }
        .date-planner button {
            background: linear-gradient(45deg, #7b2cbf, #4a4eff);
            color: white;
            border: none;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
        .date-planner button:hover {
            background: linear-gradient(45deg, #4a4eff, #7b2cbf);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <h1>MascottesWorld</h1>
        <p>Service de location de mascottes en Île-de-France</p>
    </header>

    <nav>
        <a href="#about">À propos</a>
        <a href="#gallery">Nos mascottes</a>
        <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
    </nav>

    <section id="about" class="section">
        <h2>À propos</h2>
        <p>Chez MascottesWorld, nous vous proposons un large choix de mascottes pour rendre vos événements inoubliables ! Que ce soit pour des anniversaires, mariages, fêtes scolaires ou autres, trouvez la mascotte parfaite pour divertir vos invités.</p>
    </section>

    <section id="gallery" class="section">
        <h2>Nos mascottes</h2>
        <div class="gallery">
            <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/150" alt="Mascotte Mickey">
            <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/150" alt="Mascotte Minnie">
            <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/150" alt="Mascotte Tigrou">
            <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/150" alt="Mascotte Stitch">
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="reservation" class="section">
        <h2>Planifiez votre réservation</h2>
        <div class="date-planner">
            <h3>Sélectionnez votre date et mascotte</h3>
            <form action="#" method="POST">
                <label for="mascotte">Choisissez une mascotte :</label>
                <select id="mascotte" name="mascotte" required>
                    <option value="mickey">Mickey</option>
                    <option value="minnie">Minnie</option>
                    <option value="tigrou">Tigrou</option>
                    <option value="stitch">Stitch</option>
                </select>

                <label for="reservation-date">Date de réservation :</label>
                <input type="date" id="reservation-date" name="reservation_date" required>

                <button type="submit">Réserver maintenant</button>
            </form>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="contact" class="section">
        <h2>Contactez-nous</h2>
        <div class="form-container">
            <form action="#" method="POST">
                <label for="name">Nom :</label>
                <input type="text" id="name" name="name" required>

                <label for="email">Email :</label>
                <input type="email" id="email" name="email" required>

                <label for="date">Date de l'événement :</label>
                <input type="date" id="date" name="date" required>

                <label for="message">Message :</label>
                <textarea id="message" name="message" rows="4" required></textarea>

                <button type="submit">Envoyer</button>
            </form>
        </div>
    </section>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2025 MascottesWorld - Tous droits réservés</p>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>
